    "description": "Market square, level 2 of 3: L1 plus flourish 2. Over budget: 620 blocks vs 221 (15 x 15 instead of 11 x 11, so four full stalls fit). Flush piece (ground_layer 0: the paving replaces the grass; the mod's builders can't do that yet). A paved square (stone brick border, cobblestone, gravel aisles in from all four sides) with four market stalls (the market stall design, red-white and brown-white awnings) round a stepped stone market cross; benches face the cross. L2: the cross head with lanterns, stalls open for trade, a weighing scale (lectern), a strongbox, banner poles and lantern posts at the entrances. L3: flower beds round the cross, banners on the stall backs, stall stools and banners, goods stacked at the sides. Not yet builder-tested: chiseled_stone_bricks, lectern, melon, pumpkin, red_banner, red_wool, stone_brick_wall, white_banner, white_wool, yellow_wool. Decoration step adds: item, sign_text.",
